@* حوار إعدادات نقطة البيع: تحكم في الأعمدة والحجم واللون وعرض السلة (يُحفظ تلقائيًا) *@
@inject IStringLocalizer<SharedResources> Loc
@inject IJSRuntime Js
@inject IDialogService DialogService

<MudDialog>
    <TitleContent>
        <MudText Typo="Typo.h6">@Loc["PosSettings"]</MudText>
    </TitleContent>
    <DialogContent>
        <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:20px;">
            <div>
                <MudText Typo="Typo.subtitle2">@Loc["PosColumns"]: @_columns</MudText>
                <MudSlider T="int" Min="4" Max="8" Step="1" @bind-Value="_columns" />
            </div>

            <div>
                <MudText Typo="Typo.subtitle2">@Loc["PosButtonSize"]</MudText>
                <MudSelect T="string" @bind-Value="_size" Variant="Variant.Outlined">
                    <MudSelectItem T="string" Value="@("small")">@Loc["Small"]</MudSelectItem>
                    <MudSelectItem T="string" Value="@("medium")">@Loc["Medium"]</MudSelectItem>
                    <MudSelectItem T="string" Value="@("large")">@Loc["Large"]</MudSelectItem>
                </MudSelect>
            </div>

            <div>
                <MudText Typo="Typo.subtitle2">@Loc["PosAccentColor"]</MudText>
                <div style="display:flex; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap;">
                    @foreach (var c in _colors)
                    {
                        <button type="button" @onclick="() => _accent = c"
                                style="width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:3px solid @(_accent == c ? "#1F2937" : "transparent"); background:@c; cursor:pointer; padding:0;"></button>
                    }
                </div>
            </div>

            <div>
                <MudText Typo="Typo.subtitle2">@Loc["PosCartWidth"]: @_cartWidth px</MudText>
                <MudSlider T="int" Min="500" Max="800" Step="20" @bind-Value="_cartWidth" />
            </div>

            <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;">
                <div>
                    <MudText Typo="Typo.subtitle2">@Loc["PosHideItems"]</MudText>
                    <MudText Typo="Typo.caption" Style="color:var(--erp-muted)">@Loc["PosHideItemsHint"]</MudText>
                </div>
                <MudSwitch @bind-Value="_hideItems" Color="Color.Primary" />
            </div>

            <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;">
                <div>
                    <MudText Typo="Typo.subtitle2">@Loc["PosHideCustomer"]</MudText>
                    <MudText Typo="Typo.caption" Style="color:var(--erp-muted)">@Loc["PosHideCustomerHint"]</MudText>
                </div>
                <MudSwitch @bind-Value="_hideCustomer" Color="Color.Primary" />
            </div>

            <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;">
                <div>
                    <MudText Typo="Typo.subtitle2">@Loc["PosHideDiscount"]</MudText>
                    <MudText Typo="Typo.caption" Style="color:var(--erp-muted)">@Loc["PosHideDiscountHint"]</MudText>
                </div>
                <MudSwitch @bind-Value="_hideDiscount" Color="Color.Primary" />
            </div>

            @* إعدادات الطابعة — تفتح نافذة منبثقة فرعية *@
            <MudButton Variant="Variant.Filled" Color="Color.Primary" FullWidth="true"
                       StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Print" OnClick="OpenPrinterSettings">
                @Loc["PrinterSettings"]
            </MudButton>
        </div>
    </DialogContent>
    <DialogActions>
        <MudButton OnClick="Cancel" Color="Color.Default">@Loc["Cancel"]</MudButton>
        <MudButton OnClick="SaveAsync" Variant="Variant.Filled" Color="Color.Primary">@Loc["Save"]</MudButton>
    </DialogActions>
</MudDialog>

@code {
    [CascadingParameter] private IMudDialogInstance MudDialog { get; set; } = default!;

    [Parameter] public int Columns { get; set; } = 6;
    [Parameter] public string Size { get; set; } = "medium";
    [Parameter] public string Accent { get; set; } = "#6D5BD0";
    [Parameter] public int CartWidth { get; set; } = 720;
    [Parameter] public bool HideItems { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public bool HideCustomer { get; set; } = true;
    [Parameter] public bool HideDiscount { get; set; } = true;

    private int _columns = 6;
    private string _size = "medium";
    private string _accent = "#6D5BD0";
    private int _cartWidth = 720;
    private bool _hideItems;
    private bool _hideCustomer = true;
    private bool _hideDiscount = true;

    private static readonly string[] _colors = new[]
    {
        "#6D5BD0", "#3B82F6", "#14B8A6", "#F59E0B", "#EC4899", "#10B981"
    };

    protected override void OnInitialized()
    {
        _columns = Columns;
        _size = Size;
        _accent = Accent;
        _cartWidth = CartWidth;
        _hideItems = HideItems;
        _hideCustomer = HideCustomer;
        _hideDiscount = HideDiscount;
    }

    private void Cancel() => MudDialog.Cancel();

    /// <summary>يفتح حوار إعدادات الطابعة (نافذة منبثقة فرعية: الترويسة/الهاتف/الترحيب/مقاس الورق).</summary>
    private async Task OpenPrinterSettings()
    {
        await DialogService.ShowAsync<PrinterSettingsDialog>(
            Loc["PrinterSettings"],
            new DialogParameters(),
            new DialogOptions { MaxWidth = MaxWidth.Small, FullWidth = true });
    }

    private async Task SaveAsync()
    {
        var scale = _size switch { "small" => 0.85, "large" => 1.2, _ => 1.0 };
        await Js.InvokeVoidAsync("erpApplyPosSettings", _columns, _cartWidth, _accent, scale);

        var json = System.Text.Json.JsonSerializer.Serialize(new
        {
            columns = _columns,
            size = _size,
            accent = _accent,
            cartWidth = _cartWidth,
            hideItems = _hideItems,
            hideCustomer = _hideCustomer,
            hideDiscount = _hideDiscount
        });
        await Js.InvokeVoidAsync("erpSavePosSettings", json);

        MudDialog.Close(DialogResult.Ok(true));
    }
}